<title>SPAIN: Telefonica sale awaits &quot;golden share&quot; decree.</title>
<headline>Telefonica sale awaits &quot;golden share&quot; decree.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sale of Spain's 21 percent stake in telecommunications group Telefonica is still pending the &quot;golden share&quot; decree, the government said in a statement on Friday.</p>
</text>
